      "question": "When will Social Security run out?",
      "answer": "The retirement (OASI) trust fund is projected to be depleted in 2032, one year earlier than the 2025 report projected. If the retirement and disability funds were combined, the date would be 2034. CBO projects fiscal year 2032 for the retirement fund and 2033 for the combined funds."
    },
