      "question": "Is Social Security going away in 2027?",
      "answer": "No, nothing in the 2026 Trustees Report projections has benefits stopping in 2027. Benefits get a 3.6% COLA in 2027, as covered in our guide to [2027 Social Security changes](/guides/social-security-changes-2027/). The retirement fund's projected depletion date is 2032."
